<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6843"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 5:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Part way through this video, there is a man speaking to the camera in a black jacket, who is he? And how can we find out? Obviously with WPD in some fashion. <a href="http://kshb.dayport.com/viewer/viewerpage.php?Art_ID=95435" target=_top>http://kshb.dayport.com/viewer/viewerpage.php?Art_ ID=95435</a> <BR> <BR>Back on Feb. 2nd I posted here <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/3/26.html?1107964722" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/3/26.html? 1107964722</a> <BR> <BR>About the way BTK pronounced the word homicide. The man in this video pronounced it the very same way!!!!!!! VERY UNUSUAL WAY TO PRONOUNCE IT! The man in the video needs to be found immediately! If this man in the video were not speaking in such a calm manner, if his speach was rushed as the speach in the phone call was, I honestly believe his voice would match! I really think this man must be found. <BR> <BR>PLEASE CHECK IT OUT! COMPARE IT WITH THE RECORDING OF THE PHONE CALL PLACED AFTER THE FOX MURDER AND SEE IF YOU DO NOT CATCH THE SAME PRONOUNIATION. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
